"source_cn":"你有没有看清，袭击列罗的人长什么样？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0AAC4887943776C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1064102038:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1064102039:1":{"text":"请振作一点。只有抓到凶手，我们才能替列罗报仇。","source_cn":"请振作一点。只有抓到凶手，我们才能替列罗报仇。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB582896D175286F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1064102040:1":{"text":"是的，造成这一切的歹徒应当受到惩罚。现在只有你能帮助我们，帮助列罗。","source_cn":"是的，造成这一切的歹徒应当受到惩罚。现在只有你能帮助我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F25DCB0993BFFD5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:55:1064102041:1":{"text":"我、我知道了……","source_cn":"我、我知道了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4532390DF144CD27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:57:1064102042:1":{"text":"袭击列罗的那个人，个子很高，头发也有些长……","source_cn":"袭击列罗的那个人，个子很高，头发也有些长……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD97C845B3CB7D0A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:58:1064102043:1":{"text":"好像……好像是是蓝眼睛。那时候天色太暗，我只是模模糊糊看到……","source_cn":"好像……好像是是蓝眼睛。那时候天色太暗，我只是模模糊糊...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44D51760DC33F8B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:59:1064102044:1":{"text":"凶手可有说过什么？我们或许能推测出他之后的去向。","source_cn":"凶手可有说过什么？我们或许能推测出他之后的去向。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A8A919C1330ED5E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:60:1064102045:1":{"text":"他、他说——","source_cn":"他、他说——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E32495DBC9AF33A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:61:1064102046:1":{"text":"……不，他什么也没说……总之，总之都是我的错！是我的错！！","source_cn":"……不，他什么也没说……总之，总之都是我的错！是我的错！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAACBA716E5DEF505","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:62:1064102047:1":{"text":"要不是我来了恩莎村，要不是我奢望幸福，要不是我赖在这儿，列罗就不会死……！呜呜呜！","source_cn":"要不是我来了恩莎村，要不是我奢望幸福，要不是我赖在这儿...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A9131F070580FC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:64:1064102048:1":{"text":"埃米妮，请不要自责，列罗的离去只是一个意外，和你没有关系。","source_cn":"埃米妮，请不要自责，列罗的离去只是一个意外，和你没有关系。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD58EC31C360B0DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:65:1064102049:1":{"text":"不，你不明白……这就是我的错！！","source_cn":"不，你不明白……这就是我的错！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53E46F8326116E20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:67:1064102050:1":{"text":"妈妈，妈妈……呜呜……","source_cn":"妈妈，妈妈……呜呜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF62270AB39B32566","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:69:1064102051:1":{"text":"唉……","source_cn":"唉……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC104553A784DD22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:70:1064102052:1":{"text":"艾达修女，你先带吉拉科出去透透气。这里交给我和康塔格修士。","source_cn":"艾达修女，你先带吉拉科出去透透气。这里交给我和康塔格修士。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62D7A8BCA8B4B60E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:71:1064102053:1":{"text":"有些话，不适合让孩子们听到。","source_cn":"有些话，不适合让孩子们听到。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C1052DFA3BCA5B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:72:1064102054:1":{"text":"是，路易莎修女。","source_cn":"是，路易莎修女。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D793980CD5ABF5E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:74:1064102055:0":{"text":"艾达牵着吉拉科来到教堂外的安静之处","source_cn":"艾达牵着吉拉科来到教堂外的安静之处","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19A190831F4D3F77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:77:1064102056:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:78:1064102057:1":{"text":"艾达姐姐，为什么……为什么我妈妈会说那样的话？","source_cn":"艾达姐姐，为什么……为什么我妈妈会说那样的话？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x613E2EEA27CF7231","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:79:1064102058:1":{"text":"还有爸爸……他真的再也不会回来了吗？","source_cn":"还有爸爸……他真的再也不会回来了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F847C9A8B4AEDB1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:80:1064102059:1":{"text":"……他已经回归了女神的天国，他会在那里获得安息。","source_cn":"……他已经回归了女神的天国，他会在那里获得安息。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7416EAC539097F81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:81:1064102060:1":{"text":"至于你母亲，她只是受到的打击太大，一时无法接受现实。","source_cn":"至于你母亲，她只是受到的打击太大，一时无法接受现实。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99621CF4515528A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:82:1064102061:1":{"text":"如果你能坚强地陪伴她度过这段时间，她一定很快就能好起来。明白吗？","source_cn":"如果你能坚强地陪伴她度过这段时间，她一定很快就能好起来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9421208ABC78EBD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:83:1064102062:1":{"text":"我……我知道。爸爸以前经常和我说，要保护妈妈……","source_cn":"我……我知道。爸爸以前经常和我说，要保护妈妈……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B017DB464EDCA23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:84:1064102063:1":{"text":"可是，坏人还没有抓到……要是他还想伤害我妈妈，我该怎么办？","source_cn":"可是，坏人还没有抓到……要是他还想伤害我妈妈，我该怎么办？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37028ADFB4015103","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:85:1064102064:1":{"text":"坏人……为什么没有受到惩罚呢？","source_cn":"坏人……为什么没有受到惩罚呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27ED26287DCB33A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:86:1064102065:1":{"text":"…………","source_cn":"…………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70646B5D874C111A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:87:1064102066:1":{"text":"吉拉科，我给你讲个故事吧。","source_cn":"吉拉科，我给你讲个故事吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B9D35069EA7F31B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:88:1064102067:1":{"text":"……什么故事？","source_cn":"……什么故事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1A0CF7A6F1727FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:89:1064102068:1":{"text":"你听说过侍奉艾雅的“天罚之刃”——阿塔利娅吗？","source_cn":"你听说过侍奉艾雅的“天罚之刃”——阿塔利娅吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x931833E040F3E38E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:90:1064102069:1":{"text":"天罚之刃？","source_cn":"天罚之刃？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3EED1E4F3029AB1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:91:1064102070:1":{"text":"在圣典的记载中，阿塔利娅是艾雅女神的骑枪，也是第一位蒙受女神恩典、化为人形的半神。","source_cn":"在圣典的记载中，阿塔利娅是艾雅女神的骑枪，也是第一位蒙...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x930FCC3CF633A723","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:92:1064102071:1":{"text":"在传说中，她是嫉恶如仇的正义裁决者，肩负着肃清邪恶的使命。","source_cn":"在传说中，她是嫉恶如仇的正义裁决者，肩负着肃清邪恶的使命。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC69DE6DC24883E5B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:93:1064102072:1":{"text":"如果有人被恶人伤害，只要虔诚地向阿塔利娅大人祈祷，她就会从天而降，将邪恶之徒绳之以法。没有任何罪恶能够逃脱。","source_cn":"如果有人被恶人伤害，只要虔诚地向阿塔利娅大人祈祷，她就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC713A741FB94250","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:94:1064102073:1":{"text":"……真的吗？只要虔诚地祈祷，坏人就能得到惩罚？","source_cn":"……真的吗？只要虔诚地祈祷，坏人就能得到惩罚？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DFB542C036F3C3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:95:1064102074:1":{"text":"当然，阿塔利娅大人可是正义的裁决者。","source_cn":"当然，阿塔利娅大人可是正义的裁决者。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8EA786770AB26DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:96: